@1 = ~Flying Ship of Halruaa~
@2 = ~I need to return to Shandalar and tell him that a gnome found the silver rod before us and fled with it.~
@3 = ~I need to travel to the Friendly Arm Inn and recover Shandalar's silver rod from Ervin Quill.~
@4 = ~I need to return to Shandalar and report what happened at the Friendly Arm Inn.~
@5 = ~I need to find Shandalar's daughters and tell them to return to their father.~
@6 = ~I have spoken to Shandalar's daughters. I need to return to Shandalar.~
@7 = ~I have told Shandalar's daughters to return to their father. I need to return to Shandalar.~
